# As fast as writes will go from the client, not the smallest footprint:
# sixteen connections, one step changed at a time.  A held buffer of 0 is
# not held (autotuned).  Run with sixteen writers and no verify, and a
# backing file with room for them:
#     STEP_JOBS=16 NULLB_MIB=16384 ./sweep.sh <outdir> plans/16k-7-hero.plan
# About 25 minutes.  The region may run dry with autotuned buffers.
128 262144 0 prp step-copy-n16
128 0 0 prp step-copy-n16
256 0 0 prp step-copy-n16
256 0 0 sgl step-copy-n16
256 0 16 sgl step-on-n16
256 1048576 16 sgl step-on-n16
256 0 16 prp step-on-n16
